Hi {Owner},

I build recruiting sites and shipper tools for trucking and logistics companies around {City}. On the {Business Name} site I couldn't find a driver application that works on a phone, a lane rate request for shippers, or pages for each terminal and equipment type.

I built a sample before asking for your time: a driver recruiting hub with home time and lease-on details, a short mobile application, a lane rate request, terminal and equipment pages, a warehouse section and a safety page, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If it's useful, I move it to your domain and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, changes and new openings. If not, it comes down at the end of the month.

Would thirty minutes with you and your recruiting lead work this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

